# Rule content

Sometimes the developer will not have the time or will simply forget to get back to that tag. This rule is meant to track those tags and to ensure that they do not go unnoticed. <pre>
private int Divide(int numerator, int denominator)
{
return numerator / denominator; // FIXME denominator value might be 0
}
</pre>
